  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the ttukbaegi earthenware vessel over medium heat.",
    "Cook the rice noodles according to the package instructions and set aside.",
    "Grill the chicken and slice it into thin strips.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the fish sauce, lime juice, and sesame oil.",
    "Add the crushed amaretti cookies to the bowl and stir to combine.",
    "Add the cooked noodles, grilled chicken, and chopped peanuts to the bowl and toss to combine.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a molcajete and serve immediately.",
    "Garnish with additional peanuts and amaretti cookies if desired."
